08c9becab740ab2c375b970f376a7638f44c9e8e:docs/security/POST_QUANTUM_TRANSITION_V1.md:5:Machine state: [`config/pon/post-quantum-transition-v1.json`](../../config/pon/post-quantum-transition-v1.json). The existing `config/consensus-mainline.json` and `config/pon/devnet-v1.json` keep their false activation flags and their actual 2048/1048576-byte limits. An isolated prototype MUST NOT use either of those names/identities to claim consensus acceptance.
